// Title: Suspicious JavaScript Execution Via Mshta.EXE
// Rule ID: 67f113fa-e23d-4271-befa-30113b3e08b1
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1218.005
// Category: process_creation
